# WHAT IS NOT COMMITTED HERE, AND WHY.
#
# The full run is ~4 MB, and ~3.6 MB of that is regenerable render INTERMEDIATE — five Blender piece
# sets, five supersampled raw tree renders, five emitted islands and the run logs. ADR-0367's
# Consequences already accept that committed PNG weight rises for land art; that is an argument for
# carrying the delivered EVIDENCE, not five copies of the scaffolding that produced it.
#
# What makes the exclusion safe rather than lossy is that every stage is asserted deterministic and
# the assertions are recorded, so a reader can rebuild any of this and compare:
#   · `emit_island.ts` re-emits byte-identically at its default (digest 1fa6ce51565e537a)
#   · every Blender piece re-renders raster-identical (the claim is on the DECODED raster — Blender
#     stamps the PNG container, so a file hash reports drift that does not exist)
#   · the 20-degree tree frame is pixel-identical to the delivered `code-blender` frame-18
# and each delivered picture's `.provenance.json` sidecar carries a hash per input piece plus the
# agreed code state, so a rebuild can be checked against what actually produced the committed image.
#
# COMMITTED: the two sheets, the five 1:1 panels, every provenance sidecar, the reports, the
# per-angle DELIVERED tree frame + its registration (small, and the direct input to the cost
# picture), the README and the three scripts.
# Reproduce the rest with the commands in README.md § Reproduce.

islands/
logs/
tree-*/raw/

# THE PIECE RENDERS STAY OUT; THEIR DECLARATION DOES NOT (2026-08-19).
# `pieces-*/` was excluded whole, which took `render-meta.json` — ~2 KB of text declaring the code
# state AND the `--samples` the pieces were measured at — out with ~3.6 MB of PNG. That is what left
# these panels' fidelity reachable only from `sweep-report.json`, a file nothing links them to: PR
# #1379 spent a lane on 34,970 px vs 34,968 because a reader resolving the panels' declared
# `blender_land.py@15927bf5` against the committed corpus finds only 48-sample directories from other
# passes, while these were rendered at 32. Keeping the declaration makes each piece directory
# self-describing by the same mechanism every other pass on this arc already uses, and lets
# `chapter2-sample-fidelity-2026-08-19/scan_fidelity.py` see the split. The PNGs remain excluded for
# exactly the reasons above.
pieces-*/*
!pieces-*/render-meta.json
